FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785109700
OL,3,CBurnham to host Zelensky with pledge
OL,4,Cof unwavering support for Ukraine
OL,6,FThey will visit a naval base where Mr
OL,7,FBurnham will announce that Britain
OL,8,Fwill hand over the intellectual
OL,9,Fproperty behind its new "Stone Cloak"
OL,10,Felectronic warfare system, enabling
OL,11,FUkraine to produce the technology at
OL,12,Fscale.
OL,14,FThe tablet-sized device is designed to
OL,15,Fblock Russian detection of any drones
OL,16,Fit is fitted to.
OL,18,FThe Ministry of Defence has already
OL,19,Fgiven thousands of the jammers to
OL,20,FUkrainian forces to bolster their
OL,21,Fdrone operations.
OL,26,@qD@YOUqD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785109700
OL,3,CBurnham to host Zelensky with pledge
OL,4,Cof unwavering support for Ukraine
OL,6,FMr Burnham said in a statement:
OL,7,F"Britain stands with Ukraine, shoulder
OL,8,Fto shoulder, and our support remains
OL,9,Funwavering.
OL,11,F"Russia should be in no doubt of our
OL,12,Fresolve and we will not back down
OL,13,Funtil we achieve long-lasting and just
OL,14,Fpeace for Ukraine.
OL,16,F"Stone Cloak is the best of homegrown
OL,17,FBritish innovation and proven on the
OL,18,Ffrontline, and it will be vital to
OL,19,Fprotecting our security in both our
OL,20,Fcountries."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOU|D@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785109700
OL,3,CBurnham to host Zelensky with pledge
OL,4,Cof unwavering support for Ukraine
OL,6,FFollowing its deployment in Ukraine,
OL,7,Fthe technology is expected to be
OL,8,Fincorporated into the UK's next
OL,9,Fgeneration of long-range strike
OL,10,Fweapons, including Project Brakestop,
OL,11,Fthe Government's initiative to develop
OL,12,Flow-cost cruise missiles.
OL,14,FDuring the visit, the two leaders will
OL,15,Fmeet more than 200 Ukrainian military
OL,16,Fpersonnel who have spent the past
OL,17,Fthree weeks in the UK taking part in
OL,18,FExercise Sea Breeze, aimed at
OL,19,Fstrengthening warfighting capabilities
OL,20,Fand counter-mine measures in the Black
OL,21,FSea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785109700
OL,3,CBurnham to host Zelensky with pledge
OL,4,Cof unwavering support for Ukraine
OL,6,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband said:
OL,7,F"The UK's commitment to Ukraine is
OL,8,Fresolute and steadfast. As Russia
OL,9,Fcontinues its barbaric war, we will
OL,10,Fstand shoulder to shoulder with
OL,11,FUkraine for as long as it takes.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785109700
OL,3,CBurnham to host Zelensky with pledge
OL,4,Cof unwavering support for Ukraine
OL,6,F"Ukraine is fighting not only for its
OL,7,Fown freedom and sovereignty, but for
OL,8,Fthe values of security, democracy and
OL,9,Fthe rule of law that we all share.
OL,10,FThat is why the UK is working with
OL,11,FUkraine to provide military, economic
OL,12,Fand diplomatic support, including
OL,13,Fdeveloping the cutting-edge
OL,14,Fcapabilities that will help Ukraine
OL,15,Fprevail in the war."
OL,17,FMr Burnham spoke to Mr Zelensky in one
OL,18,Fof his first calls after taking office
OL,19,Flast Monday and invited the Ukrainian
OL,20,Fleader to visit "at the earliest
OL,21,Fopportunity".
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@TO]|D@QOU}D@LO]
