PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785109700
OL,3,CBurnham to host Zelensky with pledge
OL,4,Cof unwavering support for Ukraine
OL,6,FThe new Prime Minister, who has little
OL,7,Fforeign policy experience from his
OL,8,Fprevious time in government, had vowed
OL,9,Fto maintain his predecessor Sir Keir
OL,10,FStarmer's resolute support for Ukraine
OL,11,Fbefore entering No 10.
OL,13,FSir Keir visited Kyiv on his final
OL,14,Ffull day as Labour leader.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
